pbwinput 1
# From power-on through the start menu's NEW GAME and the whole intro (overlay 294) to the field's first script
# (port/cmake/app.cmake's replay_new_game): Professor Juniper's talk, the player's sex and name, the rival's name,
# then the season banner and the opening's 3D flight over Aspertia City. Video frames, as start_menu.pbwinput, which
# this starts as. The presses land the same way on the DS, which plays the file through the intro and the opening
# into the field's first script and its first line, "Oh, hi!" (pbw-oracle), though it reaches each screen later than
# the port: NEW GAME once the start menu shows on both, then A twice a second until the DS is past the intro. Every
# press finds the game waiting or printing, so their timing doesn't change where the game goes; the name entries take
# them as letters and finish at seven, so the names come out AAAAAAA and HughAAA
version b2_us
frames video
3900 START
3910 -
# NEW GAME, the start menu's first item without a save; then the talk, the choices and the name entries
